The Windows source adapters in src/parsers.cjs and src/sources.cjs adapt the
behavior of EHentaiParser.kt, ExHentaiParser.kt, HitomiParser.kt,
EHentaiGalleriesMetadata.kt, and assets/hitomi_pages.js. They have been rewritten
in JavaScript for Chromium sessions and a streaming Windows download queue.
The browser layout and colors draw from activity_browser.xml and
values/colors-palette.xml. This is an independent Windows port.

Original copyright and license notices remain in the reference source tree.
